nd hosts a top 5% globally ranked podcast &#8212; and she takes great pride in supporting her clients on their journey toward healing and personal growth.</p><p>This is the same material she teaches from the stage, structured so you can work through it on your own time.</p>","align":"left","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=text","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"3e451f9","elType":"section","settings":{"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#FCEADF","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"80","right":"0","bottom":"80","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":{"unit":"px","size":1140,"sizes":[]},"gap":"extended"},"elements":[{"id":"c5ccd80","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":60,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"4fc2d03","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Get a Look <span style=\"font-family: 'epicursive', sans-serif; color: #f29057; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;\">Inside</span>","align":"center","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":54,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":29,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary","title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false},{"id":"1c41885","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Eight weeks of content across 14 teaching modules, with reflection exercises throughout &#8212; around 30&#8211;45 minutes a week.</p>","align":"center","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=text","text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false},{"id":"dc3ebff","elType":"widget","widgetType":"toggle","settings":{"tabs":[{"tab_title":"The Hidden Costs of Weak Boundaries","tab_content":"<p>Module 1: Signs You Might Be a Doormat</p><p>Module 2: When &#8220;Yes&#8221; Becomes Your Default</p>","_id":"221c25f"},{"tab_title":"Building Stronger Fences &#8212; Understanding Boundaries","tab_content":"<p>Module 3: The Foundation of Boundaries</p><p>Module 4: Personal Boundaries: Your Line in the Sand</p>","_id":"6aaf76f"},{"tab_title":"Owning Your Yard &#8212; Protecting Your Space","tab_content":"<p>Module 5: Why Your Yard Matters More Than You Think</p><p>Module 6: When People Trample Your Boundaries</p>","_id":"dc6c369"},{"tab_title":"The Art of Boundaries &#8212; Support vs. Sacrifice","tab_content":"<p>Module 7: Small Steps, Big Changes</p><p>Module 8: Keeping the Peace or Losing Yourself?</p>","_id":"aad6b68"},{"tab_title":"From People-Pleasing to Personal Power","tab_content":"<p>Module 9: Confessions of a People-Pleaser</p><p>Module 10: From &#8220;You Made Me Mad!&#8221; to Owning Your Reactions</p>","_id":"b75b48e"},{"tab_title":"Property Lines &#8212; Where Do You Spend Your Time?","tab_content":"<p>Module 11: The Boomerang, the Noose, and the Hook</p><p>Module 12: Does Your Yard Look Like You Are Losing At Jumanji?</p>","_id":"99f73f2"},{"tab_title":"The Big Leagues: Holding Your Own","tab_content":"<p>Module 13: Setting Boundaries When You&#8217;ve Been Taught Self-Sacrifice</p><p>Module 14: Maneuvering Master Manipulators</p>","_id":"89509dd"}],"title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary","content_color":"globals/colors?id=text","title_typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=accent"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"ab83bb4","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":40,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"99ee02c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://danaskaggs.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/The.png","id":1609,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"