ly as you like.</p>","_id":"79a8afb"},{"tab_title":"How long do I have access?","tab_content":"<p>Lifetime access. Come back to the material whenever you need a refresher.</p>","_id":"a701070"},{"tab_title":"Is this therapy?","tab_content":"<p>No. This is coaching and education, not psychotherapy, and it isn&#8217;t a substitute for mental health treatment. Dana is a licensed psychotherapist and brings that training to how she teaches, but the course is educational.</p>","_id":"d26d7f7"},{"tab_title":"Can I get personal coaching alongside it?","tab_content":"<p>Yes. The coaching packages pair this course with private 90-minute calls &#8212; and the $99 you spend here is credited toward any package if you upgrade within 90 days. <a href=\"https://danaskaggs.com/boundaries-course/\">See the coaching packages</a>.</p>","_id":"9a73aff"},{"tab_title":"What&#8217;s your refund policy?","tab_content":"<p>A 100% money-back guarantee for 7 days after purchase, provided you haven&#8217;t accessed the course content. Full terms are on the <a href=\"https://danaskaggs.com/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a> page.</p>","_id":"5cfd450"}],"title_typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=primary","content_color":"globals/colors?id=text","title_typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=accent"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"403049d","elType":"section","settings":{"background_background":"classic","background_color":"#012E41","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"85","right":"0","bottom":"85","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":{"unit":"px","size":1140,"sizes":[]},"gap":"extended"},"elements":[{"id":"96e78c3","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"93b8059","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Finally Set <span style=\"font-family: 'epicursive', sans-serif; color: #f29057; font-weight: 400; font-style: